WEBVTT

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.880
Oh, Mira, you're here.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:18.050
What is it, Amalatte? Here to see Cleos?

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:22.270
By the way, Mira, is it a policy
of yours not to wear underwear?

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:24.440
Or is that just how you like it?

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.400
Even though you wear these.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.690
I cannot figure out how to put them on.

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:30.400
I had no idea.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.990
Then, I'll teach you.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.240
What are you doing?!

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:38.370
--I'll remove mine, so watch me
as I put it back on.
--Wait! Huh?! What?! Wait! Wait! What?!

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:39.990
--I'll remove mine, so watch me
as I put it back on.
--What is this?! What is this?!

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:41.450
Hold on! No matter what, this is--

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:42.500
Miss Mira?

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.920
Mariana! No! This is, you know...
Not what you think!

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:50.920
If that is the case, it would be
my pleasure to teach you.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.470
Wha--?! Both of you, calm down!

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:56.180
Oh, Cleos! Do something!

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:58.510
It is wonderful to see you having fun.

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:02.270
Oh.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:06.140
My apologies! Solomon summoned me,
so I will be going!

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:07.400
Oh, he did?

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.110
Miss Mira, what about dinner?

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:11.610
My apologies! I will be
gone for a while again!

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:13.490
Hold down the fort for me!

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:16.450
Yes, I'll be waiting.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:19.240
Forever and always.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:56.170
"Episode 9
'I Do Not Dislike This
Sort of Turn of Events'"

00:02:59.630 --> 00:03:02.590
The sky looks as vast as ever.

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:05.760
I am glad I have you, Pegasus.

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:11.140
When I tried to summon Eisenfald again,

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:13.520
I was warned that he attracts
too much attention

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:16.320
and causes the good citizens to complain.

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:22.160
But that darn Solomon thinks
nothing of putting people to work.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.330
Based on the material you guys
brought back the other day

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:28.200
from Fool the Wunderkammer,

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:31.120
we've figured out the destination
of your next adventure.

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.250
Oh-ho, where is it?

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:36.090
It's the Child of Prayer Forest.

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:39.920
"Main Quest: Investigate
the Child of Prayer Forest"

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:39.920
That forest, is it?
It brings back memories.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:44.720
But how are the Child of Prayer
Forest and Soul Howl related?

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:49.850
He's on a quest to find the
Holy Grail of Heavenly Light,

00:03:49.850 --> 00:03:53.310
but the material that makes up
its base can be found there.

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:58.230
You need the root of a sacred tree
that's over three thousand years old.

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:01.610
Ah, the Elder of the
Child of Prayer Forest.

00:04:01.610 --> 00:04:03.530
There you have it.

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:06.740
It's highly unlikely that Soul Howl
will still be there,

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:09.700
but you might at least
find some trace of him.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:11.330
Also...

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:12.710
Also?

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:16.250
The Primal Forest is near the
Child of Prayer Forest, right?

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:20.010
"Subquest: Investigate the Devils'
Labyrinth - Primal Forest"

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:20.010
Right now, we've got a hot,
top-secret weapon in development

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:22.880
"Subquest: Investigate the Devils'
Labyrinth - Primal Forest"

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:22.880
and you might be able to find
material there that we could use.

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:25.220
So, you know, I'll be counting on you.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:27.510
Another errand for you?!

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:29.760
There's a fort near the forest,

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:32.390
so if you get tired, you can rest there.

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:35.770
What was that?

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:38.650
That was a blizzard eagle?

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:40.820
Did you kick it out of the air?

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:44.400
There, there.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.780
But, hmm...

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:47.700
That is a monster

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:50.290
that ought to live in the
northernmost tip of the continent.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:55.080
It is strange for it to
appear in the south.

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:58.460
Is this part of how this
world has changed?

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:03.470
Ah, we can see it now.

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.350
"One Hour Later"

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:19.480
"Two Hours Later"

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:27.200
"Three Hours Later"

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:30.450
Oh, honestly! Just how
gigantic is that tree?!

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:33.700
It is too big and I cannot get a sense
of the distance whatsoever!

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:41.960
That must be the fort. I think
I will rest there for a bit.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.510
What could be going on here?

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:56.890
That one...

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:02.360
Good work.

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:05.740
What's this? Who are you?

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:07.860
Could it be that you're our reinforcement?

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:12.950
I am no one suspicious. I am Mira.
Just an adventurer.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:19.750
Now, you mentioned reinforcements earlier.

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:21.330
What happened here?

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:24.250
R-Right...

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:27.380
It was two weeks ago, in the night.

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:32.600
Monsters that shouldn't be in these
forests suddenly attacked the fort.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:35.560
At first, we were happy because if we
defeated these rare monsters,

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:39.230
we could get a high price
for the material and stuff,

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:42.810
but there was one monster
that was special.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:47.490
Every night, it brings a pack
of monsters with it and attacks.

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:49.320
It'll most likely come again tonight.

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:55.330
Hm, by the looks of the fort,
you are nearly at your limit.

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:59.290
And we have a lot of wounded,
so we can't leave them and run.

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:02.250
Hey, you came by air, right?

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.130
I need a favor.

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:05.300
What is it?

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:07.550
I actually want you to
take one of our wounded

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:11.630
to the Healers' Union in a village nearby.

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.300
Mm, all right.

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.680
But before I do,

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:17.810
would you mind letting me see
what condition this person is in?

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:23.310
Melissa played decoy to save
the others from the monsters

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:25.190
and she was badly injured.

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:28.030
Over here.

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:29.360
Old Man Dolan.

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:33.370
Oh, you're the missy who
came riding a Pegasus?

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:37.700
Please. Even if it's too late,
she could at least be with family...

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:43.000
We tried using the recovery potion
that Old Man Dolan had,

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.670
but maybe she's too badly injured,
because it had no effect.

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:48.800
Hm, the potion had no effect...

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:53.720
As I thought.

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:56.100
But why might that be?

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:58.470
What is it? What's as you thought?

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:02.850
Mm, by the looks of it, she is
suffering from maso poison.

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:05.270
This poison markedly reduces
the effect of all recovery,

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:09.530
not only from natural healing,
but from medicines and such as well.

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:11.190
B-But then...

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:15.990
It is a poison that, by rights, does
not exist on this continent, though.

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:19.370
The blizzard eagle and now this.
What is going on?

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:22.540
Damn it! What are we supposed
to do against something like that?

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:29.090
Well, you know, now that we know
the cause, it is not a serious problem.

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:30.460
What do you mean?

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:32.420
It's a poison that no medicine
can cure, right?

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:34.470
Well, just watch.

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:41.980
From the ring, come forth,
healer of pure white.

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:49.400
Is that evocation magic?

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:52.650
A dependable doctor. Leave it to this one.

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:56.740
It has been a while. Sorry to trouble you,
but look after this one.

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:04.160
Hey!

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:06.040
If you want her saved, be quiet!

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.420
But I mean...

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:25.140
Good work.

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:28.480
H-Huh?

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:29.900
--Melissa!
--She's awake!

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:32.030
Ratri?

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:36.150
The pain just kind of
miraculously disappeared.

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:38.870
The end must be near for me...

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:47.000
I don't really understand
what exactly happened,

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:50.920
but the snake did something
and that saved Melissa, right?

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:53.250
Mm, you needn't worry yourself.

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:57.090
But she was only treated for
the poison and her injuries,

00:09:57.090 --> 00:10:00.140
so the blood and strength
she lost remains the same.

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:04.810
Make sure she eats and rests well,
so she can fully recuperate.

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:07.020
Thank you. Thank you!

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:09.980
I guess evocation magic is amazing!

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:13.230
She's a close friend of mine.

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:15.820
I'm so glad... I'm so glad.

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:18.950
The sacred white snake, Asclepius, is it?

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:20.570
This was my first time seeing it,

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:23.790
but I see summoners
are still going strong.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:26.120
Oh-ho, you know of it.

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:29.040
Well, it comes of my long
years as a hunter.

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:33.170
By your chanting earlier, I take it
you're quite a high-level summoner.

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:37.970
If only the world were
full of people like you.

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:43.260
Now, then, that just leaves that monster.

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:45.890
Do you have an idea of where it is?

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:50.310
At this hour, it should be making
its rounds in the surrounding forest.

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:51.940
You plan to go, don't you?

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:57.030
In that case, shield or bait,
make free use of these old bones.

00:10:57.030 --> 00:10:58.820
We'll lend a hand, too.

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:01.530
Are you sure? We may not be able to win.

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:03.910
We pile on when we see a shot at victory.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:06.240
That's the secret to living a long life.

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:08.870
Now that we've seen
your evocation magic...

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:10.080
Oh-ho.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:13.630
I do not dislike this
sort of turn of events.

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:14.460
However...

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:15.460
Hold on!

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:17.130
Rather than fight, wouldn't it be better

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:20.090
to take the guaranteed escape by air,
even if it's one person at a time?

00:11:20.090 --> 00:11:22.890
That monster so much as grazes you,
you sustain serious injuries.

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:24.760
A direct hit and it's instant death.

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:26.680
Even if we have a great
healer to support us,

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:29.310
it's not an opponent we can take head on!

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:31.730
Well, I suppose that is
to be expected of youth

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:34.310
who know nothing of the ways
of evocation magic.

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:35.570
It cannot be helped.

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:37.070
Healer, eh?

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:40.150
Real evocation magic is more than that.

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:42.360
Isn't that right, Mira?

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:43.660
Of course.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:47.330
The true worth of evocation magic
is that it can adapt to any situation.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:48.830
B-But...

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:49.830
I'm going.

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:50.960
Ratri?

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:53.750
Mira saved Melissa's life.

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:57.460
So, if Mira says she's doing this,
then I'm coming, too.

00:11:57.460 --> 00:12:00.670
Having said that, it's not like I want
to throw my life away, either.

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:03.050
We'll need a solid plan.

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:05.430
Then, how about something like this?

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:10.100
Wh-What's this guy?

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:13.560
We will withstand the monster's
attack with my holy knight.

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:16.770
However, as you can see,
it's specialized for defense.

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:19.940
Whether we can defeat the monster
or not will be up to you folk.

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:23.990
How about it? Anyone with
the courage to give it a try?

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:26.450
That evocation magic truly is amazing.

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:29.290
I think she's worth taking a chance on.

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:34.420
Though, I'm no good in a fight,
so I'll have to leave it to you all.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:38.290
This one was making repairs
at a furious pace earlier.

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:41.460
If even Tomoki says so, want
to try putting our trust in her?

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:44.050
I guess we could. If there's a chance...

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:46.640
We're hunters, after all.

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:49.930
Mm, this is how it should be with youths.

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:52.310
Thinking of what is good for their future,

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:55.900
they will need to conquer
their fear themselves.

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:57.900
I'm grateful for your thoughtfulness.

00:12:57.900 --> 00:13:00.230
Oh? I know not what you mean.

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:03.360
But it seems the people
of this world really are living

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:06.200
with minds of their own.

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:11.240
All the more reason to help them,
if it is within my power to do so.

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:22.710
I promise you this.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:24.380
No matter what situation
we find ourselves in,

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:26.430
I will absolutely protect you folk.

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:28.680
With this plan, if we back down, we lose.

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:31.180
Everyone, keep looking ahead
and nowhere else!

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:32.970
All right, here we go!

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:34.350
Yeah!

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:36.770
Straight ahead this way.

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:39.440
There's no knowing when it'll notice us.

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:40.900
Let's hurry.

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:43.780
Mm, not a single bird in sight.

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:47.200
With a monster that
powerful lurking about,

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:49.410
they've all fled.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:51.330
That makes sense.

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:56.710
We can do this if we stick to the plan.

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.250
Let's hurry.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:02.050
All right, I will hold it
off here for a time.

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:05.340
You folk go on ahead
and get into position.

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:06.720
Are you sure we can leave this to you?

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:09.180
Just who do you think I am?

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:24.320
This monster... I see.

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:27.860
A tyrant spikeback.

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:34.290
I think I will take care of the small fry.

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:49.430
I heard a loud noise.
Is she really all right?

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:52.680
Do you hear that?!

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:58.770
Our white knight remains undefeated,
fending off the monsters' attacks!

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:02.020
Now is the time to run!
Our target location is just ahead!

00:15:02.020 --> 00:15:03.690
Yeah!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:07.940
They appear to be ready.

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:27.130
Now, here comes the real fight.

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:28.210
Attack!

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:43.900
No!

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:47.820
That white knight is fast!

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:51.070
Fear not! I told you I would protect you!

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.820
That's right! You saw it!

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:55.370
This is what real evocation magic is!

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:57.080
There's no need for you to worry!

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:58.870
Take your weapons and rise up!

00:15:58.870 --> 00:15:59.700
R-Right!

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:01.120
Yeah, I'm doing this.

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.460
I'll do it!

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:07.590
Take that!

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:09.760
Hi-ya!

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:14.930
Pull back!

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:16.600
Evasive action!

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:20.480
Now!

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:34.360
Ah, thanks.

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:35.950
You're a great help.

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:44.870
That's it! That's the spirit!

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:46.790
It's definitely working!

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:49.130
It's starting to get sluggish, too.

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:51.170
We keep at it, we can do this!

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:56.340
Wh-What the--?!

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:09.940
D-Don't tell me...

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:16.200
Now!

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:25.500
You're mine!

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:33.920
Ratri!

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:35.590
I'm all right.

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:37.720
It shouldn't have any more strength...

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:47.520
We did it!

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:50.320
--They did it.
--We did it!

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:52.480
--We did it!
--We did it!

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:59.280
But man, whoever said that
evocation magic was weak?

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:01.700
They must have never seen the real thing.

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:03.290
Yeah, right?

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:07.170
Until I saw it for myself,
even I didn't...

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:10.670
Thank you. I think everyone
can bounce back now.

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:12.130
No thanks is necessary.

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:14.840
If they did not have the will
to do so to begin with,

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:16.720
things would not have turned out this way.

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:18.930
Even after having their
spirits broken once,

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:21.720
if they can still find the courage
to stand and fight,

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:24.220
that is to be commended.

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:27.100
I see. I suppose so.

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:38.280
Thank you very much for helping everyone.

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:43.830
Eh, it was because you supported
my plan before we left.

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:46.750
They must all have a lot of faith in you.

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:48.000
Oh, please.

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:50.540
You are a former player, too, yes?

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:53.590
Yes. But I'm a crafting specialist,

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:56.880
so at times like this,
I find myself really envious.

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:59.050
By the way, I want to ask you something.

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:03.560
Before, monsters never appeared
outside of their habitat,

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:06.310
but is that something that
happens all the time now?

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:10.650
No, I believe it is impossible
without extenuating circumstances.

00:19:10.650 --> 00:19:14.230
In other words, human intervention?

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:18.530
But in that case, what could be the cause?

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:20.530
I wonder.

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:26.160
Mira!

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:28.120
Thank you!

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:29.960
See you again!

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:34.540
Now, then, I took quite the detour, but...

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:37.760
We have finally arrived
at our destination.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:43.430
Elder, there is something I wish to ask.

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:45.760
Will you not show yourself?

00:19:58.150 --> 00:19:59.860
What do you want?

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:01.740
My apologies for disturbing you.

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:07.080
I have come to see if anyone came
here earlier seeking your roots.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:10.290
Will you not tell me
if anyone comes to mind?

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:17.090
I remember that man.

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:21.050
It was an unprecedented request,
so it made an impression on me.

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:23.550
When it was has slipped my mind,

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:27.060
but he had black hair
and wore a white mask.

00:20:27.060 --> 00:20:28.720
I remember him, too.

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:32.980
He was the one who brought along
lots of tasty food in exchange, right?

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:35.650
I wish he'd come again.

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:38.610
Yes, as I recall, in order
to make a goblet,

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:42.110
he said he needed some other black thing.

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:44.110
Hm, I see.

00:20:44.110 --> 00:20:48.330
It seems that is unmistakably
the man I am looking for.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:52.580
Oh, yes. This is unrelated
to my earlier question,

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:56.670
but I hear unfamiliar monsters have
been appearing in these woods lately.

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:58.040
Do you know anything?

00:20:58.040 --> 00:20:59.630
The particulars are a mystery.

00:20:59.630 --> 00:21:03.720
However, I sense something
warped to the east.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:06.180
Warped, you say...

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:08.810
Lord Indigo Beard of Leafy Shade,

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:10.770
I am grateful for the
information at this time.

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:13.600
Such being the case,
I would like to offer you these.

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:15.480
Human sweets!

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:18.270
We have not had an offering
of sweets in some time.

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:20.610
I am most gratified that you are happy.

00:21:20.610 --> 00:21:23.490
I still have a lot more,
so please accept them.

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:26.070
Mm, for my part, though,
I would have been happy

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:29.370
if you had simply performed
a bit of elimination there.

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:30.870
What... did you say?

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:33.160
With the magical power
you harbor within you,

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:36.040
it should bear some excellent fruit.

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:38.250
Oh, that would've been nice, too.

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:40.750
Mm, it would serve as fine fertilizer.

00:21:40.750 --> 00:21:42.460
Next time.

00:21:43.470 --> 00:21:46.890
I am so glad I brought
the boxes of sweets.

00:21:46.890 --> 00:21:51.560
I came this close to being forced
to expose myself out here.

00:21:53.770 --> 00:21:55.520
But now that it is on my mind...

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:57.600
Perhaps because of the
apple au lait I drank earlier...

00:21:57.600 --> 00:21:59.270
Oh, well, well...

00:21:59.270 --> 00:22:01.190
You want to pee-pee?

00:22:01.190 --> 00:22:03.530
You read my consciousness?!

00:22:03.530 --> 00:22:06.110
You may be gods, but there is such
a thing as crossing the line!

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:08.780
I hear it is not good to
hold it in, child of man.

00:22:08.780 --> 00:22:12.200
Come, an offering from your own person.

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:18.750
I do not want to!
